  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF Inclusive Security and Resilient Youth (ISRY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased local Jordanian resilience to destabilising tensions, greater mutual trust and accountability between youth and women, communities and security actors and enhanced public safety.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific Objective 1: Enhance youth and community participation in initiatives for the prevention of violence, including in the online spaceSpecific Objective 2 : Create a more trusted and gender equal partnership between Public Security Department (PSD) and women, men, youth and all ethnicities in promoting peace and securitySpecific Objective 3: Greater participation of youth and women in peace and security at the national level, including in leadership</narrative>
  </description>
